//
//  1. An enum BugStatus with three values: OPEN, IN_PROGRESS, RESOLVED
//  2. A model Project  (id, name)  that has many Bugs
//  3. A model Bug      (id, title, status [enum, default OPEN], createdAt)
//     that belongs to one Project
